{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Have You Been Waiting for a Modern Take on Classic Asteroid Shooters?</strong> \ud83d\ude80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your wait might just be over! <i>Astro Busters</i> brings you a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics, responsive controls, and thrilling arcade action. Take on missions, upgrade your weapons and ships, and battle fierce enemies in deep space!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's included in the demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Play through the first level and uncover hidden secrets<br>\u2705 Test multiple weapons, ships, and upgrades<br>\u2705 Face off against challenging enemies and a powerful boss<br>\u2705 Experience fast-paced arcade space combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s NOT included in the demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u274c Limited levels and weapons<br>\u274c No multiplayer</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Also available on Android!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to blast asteroids on the go with touchscreen controls? Try the <strong><i>Astro Busters Demo</i></strong> on Google Play and experience the action on your phone or tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Visit our website for the link)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoying the game? Add <i>Astro Busters</i> to your wishlist and get ready for the full version, featuring <strong>more levels, more weapons, and multiplayer battles!</strong> \ud83c\udf20</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626630?t=1745267598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626630/0eaca89e8c980812f105900da7340a90548e3270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745267598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626630/c1b967fb04204f0013df7ee84c205e5c877e49b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745267598","capsu